    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      108.02,
      621.77,
      541.42,
      635.77
    ],
    "text": "On or about 23/05/2001, in Meegahathanna the Accused caused the",
