    "fonts": [
      "BookmanOldStyle",
      "BookmanOldStyle-Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      714.32,
      541.51,
      728.32
    ],
    "text": "2] At the trial, all three Accused pleaded not guilty to the charges and selected",
    "fonts": [
      "BookmanOldStyle"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      735.43,
      541.51,
      749.44
    ],
    "text": "a non-jury trial. After a contested trial, on 10/05/2024, the learned trial judge",
    "fonts": [
      "BookmanOldStyle"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
