    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      57.58,
      541.63,
      71.58
    ],
    "text": "convicted the 1st and 2nd Accused of murder and 3rd Accused was acquitted and",
    "fonts": [
      "BookmanOldStyle"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.039999961853027,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      78.82,
      147.38,
      92.82
    ],
    "text": "discharged.",
    "fonts": [
      "BookmanOldStyle"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      137.04,
      541.57,
      151.04
    ],
    "text": "3] The incident involves robbery and fatal stabbing. P.W. 01 (the wife of the",
    "fonts": [
      "BookmanOldStyle"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      158.16,
      541.45,
      172.16
    ],
    "text": "deceased) testified that around midnight on the night of the incident, the",
    "fonts": [
      "BookmanOldStyle"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      179.28,
      541.46,
      193.28
    ],
    "text": "Accused forcibly broke into their home, threatened the family with knives,",
    "fonts": [
      "BookmanOldStyle"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      200.4,
      541.66,
      214.4
    ],
    "text": "robbed her of jewelry, and that the 1st and 2nd Accused directly stabbed her",
    "fonts": [
      "BookmanOldStyle"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      221.52,
      541.59,
      235.52
    ],
    "text": "husband. Supporting her, P.W. 02 (a relative) and P.W. 04 (the deceased\u2019s",
    "fonts": [
      "BookmanOldStyle"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      242.64,
      541.46,
      256.64
    ],
    "text": "brother) testified to hearing screams around 12:00 am and spotting suspects",
    "fonts": [
      "BookmanOldStyle"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      263.76,
      541.51,
      277.76
    ],
    "text": "fleeing the scene, with P.W. 02 and local villagers subsequently capturing and",
    "fonts": [
      "BookmanOldStyle"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      285.03,
      381.67,
      299.03
    ],
    "text": "handing over the bleeding 1st Accused to the police.",
    "fonts": [
      "BookmanOldStyle"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      343.23,
      541.66,
      357.23
    ],
    "text": "4] Judicial Medical Officer Dr. Kiribaddalage Sunil Kumara (P.W. 07) conducted",
    "fonts": [
      "BookmanOldStyle"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      364.35,
      541.66,
      378.35
    ],
    "text": "the post-mortem, revealing five total injuries including two stab wounds and",
    "fonts": [
      "BookmanOldStyle"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      385.47,
      541.44,
      399.47
    ],
    "text": "confirmed that the primary stab injury was sufficient in the ordinary course of",
    "fonts": [
      "BookmanOldStyle"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      406.59,
      541.66,
      420.59
    ],
    "text": "nature to cause immediate death. Medical evidence presented by the Judicial",
    "fonts": [
      "BookmanOldStyle"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      427.71,
      541.44,
      441.71
    ],
    "text": "Medical Officer (JMO) confirmed that the cause of death was fatal stab injuries",
    "fonts": [
      "BookmanOldStyle"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      448.83,
      541.44,
      462.83
    ],
    "text": "to the chest, flank, and ribs inflicted by a sharp, cutting, pointed weapon,",
    "fonts": [
      "BookmanOldStyle"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      469.97,
      541.66,
      483.97
    ],
    "text": "leading to cardiac damage, severe internal hemorrhage, and shock.",
    "fonts": [
      "BookmanOldStyle"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      491.09,
      541.65,
      505.09
    ],
    "text": "Furthermore, investigating officer SIP Priyadarshana (P.W. 15) and P.W. 16",
    "fonts": [
      "BookmanOldStyle"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      512.21,
      541.45,
      526.21
    ],
    "text": "testified that information disclosures made under Section 27 of the Evidence",
    "fonts": [
      "BookmanOldStyle"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      533.33,
      541.47,
      547.33
    ],
    "text": "Ordinance led directly to the recovery of productions, including the murder",
    "fonts": [
      "BookmanOldStyle"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      554.45,
      529.06,
      568.45
    ],
    "text": "knives, a torch, and a plastic gun used during the commission of the offense.",
    "fonts": [
      "BookmanOldStyle"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      596.69,
      541.63,
      610.69
    ],
    "text": "5] The evidence of the Prosecution reveals that the perpetrators gained entry into",
    "fonts": [
      "BookmanOldStyle"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      617.93,
      541.44,
      631.93
    ],
    "text": "the Victim\u2019s home by removing roof tiles above the dining area and deliberately",
    "fonts": [
      "BookmanOldStyle"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      639.05,
      541.65,
      653.05
    ],
    "text": "cutting off the main power supply. The primary direct evidence was provided by",
    "fonts": [
      "BookmanOldStyle"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      660.2,
      541.57,
      674.2
    ],
    "text": "the deceased\u2019s wife, who testified that using the beam from an electric torch held",
    "fonts": [
      "BookmanOldStyle"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      681.32,
      541.39,
      695.32
    ],
    "text": "by the 2nd Accused, she clearly observed and identified both the 1st and 2nd",
    "fonts": [
      "BookmanOldStyle"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      702.56,
      265.97,
      716.56
    ],
    "text": "Accused stabbing her husband.",
    "fonts": [
      "BookmanOldStyle"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      782.02,
      310.11,
      806.5
    ],
    "text": "4",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      57.58,
      541.45,
      71.58
    ],
    "text": "6] The 1st Accused was apprehended at 4:30 AM on the morning of the crime,",
    "fonts": [
      "BookmanOldStyle"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.039999961853027,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      78.7,
      541.65,
      92.7
    ],
    "text": "hiding under a bed in a nearby house in Meegahathanna with blood-stained",
    "fonts": [
      "BookmanOldStyle"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      99.84,
      541.66,
      113.84
    ],
    "text": "clothing and physical injuries. Following his disclosure statement (marked as P",
    "fonts": [
      "BookmanOldStyle"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      120.96,
      541.59,
      134.96
    ],
    "text": "03), police recovered a blood-stained knife (marked as P 01) under the bed.",
    "fonts": [
      "BookmanOldStyle"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      142.08,
      541.51,
      156.08
    ],
    "text": "Similarly, the 2nd Accused was detained at 4:00 AM by suspicious bus",
    "fonts": [
      "BookmanOldStyle"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      163.2,
      541.66,
      177.2
    ],
    "text": "passengers while attempting to board a Colombo-bound bus in Meegahathanna,",
    "fonts": [
      "BookmanOldStyle"
    ],
    "sizes": [
